        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity mix, operation storage pumps, ENTSO, 2020, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity mix, operation storage pumps, ENTSO, 2020, at plant
Technology shares determined based on data from ENTSO Transparency Platform. Only domestic electricity production is considered, electricity imports are neglected.; UUID:cff117a7-78f8-3ab0-b2df-40fded781954
This dataset includes the shares of different technologies of the electricity mix used for the operation of storage pumps in Germany in 2018.
Location: Germany
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistics
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cff117a7-78f8-3ab0-b2df-40fded781954.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
